{"id":"wb-3-201","name":"琉璃河遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"琉璃河遗址","text":"琉璃河遗址，是中国西周早期的重要都城遗址，位于北京市西南部的房山区琉璃河乡北1.5公里的大石河畔台地上。1988年被国务院列入全国重点文物保护单位名单。目前在遗址区建有西周燕都遗址博物馆。琉璃河遗址入选2024年度全国十大考古新发现。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%90%89%E7%92%83%E6%B2%B3%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93759119,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93759119","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/241284bf8cd8c857328bef4b.jpg","title":"琉璃河遗址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%90%89%E7%92%83%E6%B2%B3%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/%E7%90%89%E7%92%83%E6%B2%B3%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​琉璃河遗址标志碑，遗址建筑在该碑后侧","width":320,"height":237}}